  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "In VRChat, the groups you join or rep are effectively an extension of your bio.  It's a list of interests, things you find funny, or topics you might be interested in talking about.  \n\nOn a user's in-app full profile page, the current system for the 'groups' card on the full bio places the user's repped group at the top and then shows their remaining shown groups in alphabetical order.  This is wasted space and encourages groups to name themselves starting with numbers or the letter A to be shown \"above the fold\".\n\nInstead, allow users to PIN groups that interest them to the top and show those instead.  this would allow people to feature their interests and topics, which would function as a supplement to the mutual groups feature and help drive social connection.",
